    "rich_text_bKttUE": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_CbJhzE": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Are the Key Benefits of Reshoring Your Supply Chain?",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_fWciac": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Bringing your manufacturing operations and supply chain closer to home offers a number of benefits for your company, your customers, your community, and the national economy:</p><h3>Quality Control</h3><p>Overseeing daily operations becomes significantly more challenging when manufacturing takes place overseas under varying regulations and quality standards. This is especially critical for industries such as <a href=\"/pages/adhesive-tapes-medical-industry\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Adhesive Tapes Medical Industry\">healthcare</a>, automotive, <a href=\"https://www.nadco-inc.com/aerospace/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.nadco-inc.com/aerospace/\">aerospace</a>, military, and technology, where consistency and precision are essential. A domestic supply chain allows manufacturers to closely monitor production, identify issues earlier, and implement corrective actions more quickly.</p><h3>Streamlined Logistics</h3><p>Offshore manufacturing often requires finished products to spend extended periods in transit, limiting flexibility and increasing risk. By the time an issue is identified, additional shipments may already be in motion. Reshoring shortens supply lines, reduces transit times, and minimizes delays, enabling faster adjustments and more reliable delivery.</p><h3>Skilled Workforce</h3><p>Reshoring enables companies to tap into a highly skilled and motivated domestic workforce while investing in long-term talent development. Local manufacturing operations foster innovation, strengthen institutional knowledge, and help build stronger connections between employers and employees. When manufacturing thrives locally, it also supports workforce stability and community growth.</p><h3>Avoiding Complicated Taxes and Tariffs</h3><p>Global trade regulations continue to evolve, creating uncertainty around tariffs, duties, and compliance requirements. These complexities can increase costs and introduce unexpected risks for manufacturers and their customers. By reshoring production, companies can reduce exposure to trade-related volatility and gain greater cost predictability.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_CbJhzE",
        "text_fWciac"
      ],
