    "image_with_text_F8tBbH": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_QiLcpG": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Reshore With NADCO Solutions",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_neTRtJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For decades, NADCO has provided custom adhesive solutions to customers across a wide range of industries. We specialize in high-quality tapes and labels supported by responsive service and flexible production capabilities designed to meet your specific application requirements.</p><p>With short lead times, consistent product quality, and dependable customer support, we help manufacturers maintain reliable, efficient supply chains. Our team works closely with each customer to develop solutions that align with operational goals, whether for small production runs or large-scale programs.</p><p>U.S.-based manufacturing continues to grow, and NADCO is proud to be part of that momentum. Founded in New Hampshire and based in Sarasota, Florida since 2005, we serve as a trusted domestic partner for companies seeking to keep their supply chains closer to home.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\"><strong>Contact us</strong></a> to learn more about our custom tape and label solutions or to discuss your next project.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
